Row-Bot can download ffmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org/) from the imageio-ffmpeg 0.6.0 package on
PyPI (https://pypi.org/project/imageio-ffmpeg/; its wrapper code is BSD-2-Clause) and keeps
only the ffmpeg program. That program is licensed under the GNU General Public License
(version 3 or later for Windows and Linux, version 2 or later for macOS on Apple silicon); its
source is available from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html. Row-Bot runs it as a separate
program. Row-Bot never offers the macOS Intel build of that package, which is built as
not redistributable.

This product includes Chart.js 4.5.1 (https://www.chartjs.org/), Copyright (c) 2014-2024 Chart.js
Contributors, used under the MIT License; see static/pages/chart.js-LICENSE.md. Row-Bot inlines it,
